**2 strategies passed, 8 were fixed.**

The common bug in all 8 gemini strategies: entry signals were firing outside the `session_start`/`session_end` window. The fix applied to each was:
```python
in_session = (time_mins >= self.session_start) & (time_mins <= self.session_end)
long_entry &= in_session
short_entry &= in_session
```
Each fix is marked with `# AUDIT FIX:` comments at the top of the file.
